diff --git a/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7993.bugfix b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7993.bugfix
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..bedb681
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7993.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fix a crash when the ``--msg-template`` contained a custom brace pair like ``{{`` or ``}}``. Such escaped braces are now correctly ignored when looking for unknown arguments.
+
+Closes #7993
